# `helm dependency update` build output. Neither is content this repo authors:
# charts/ holds packaged subcharts, and Chart.lock is regenerated with a fresh
# `generated:` timestamp on every run. Tracking the lock made every chart-deps
# build dirty the working tree for a timestamp — noise that hides real drift,
# and it pins nothing: every dependency of this chart is a file:// path, so
# there is no version to resolve. Same rule the umbrella already applies
# (helm/gibson/.gitignore). deploy#1600.
charts/
Chart.lock
